/target
/src-tauri/gen/

# NA-0764 (`D-0041`) — Python bytecode caches. `scripts/ci/*.py` is run in place by CI
# and locally, so CPython drops a `__pycache__/` beside it; one .pyc reached a commit
# through a `git add -A` and carried an embedded ABSOLUTE BUILD PATH into the tree.
# ⚠ The infra-literal scanner did NOT catch it: it reads text and a .pyc is binary, so
# it reported the tree clean while that path sat inside the artifact. That blindness is
# filed for a later lane; this rule stops the artifact reaching the tree at all.
__pycache__/
